{
  "id": "GAL.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Jogalasia 5",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thwolo ma timo gimoro ma jokristo jonitie gine",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo otieko gonyo wan i twec to miyo wan siem! Riameno cungi win, paka ji man siem, aka wikiri wiyey lokirok ŋecin kendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Winji win! An Paulo awaco riwin gime: Ka wiyeyo thumirok, meno nyutho ni Kristo ongoye gi kony moro riwin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amito medo waco kendo ri dhano je ma yenyo ni wothum ni go onyo ripo luwo Cik je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Win ma wiyenyo nike wokethi win i tiro gi Were cungo kwoŋ Cik kole witieko pokirok kodi Kristo; aka witieko kiri podho gi eye kwoŋ nema pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To wan gi geno ni Were bino ketho wan i tiro gi go, gi meni pa Cuny Maleŋ pa Were ma tiyo i yeyo mawan; aka meno a gima wakuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole i Kristo Yesu, thumirok kosa weyo ma k'othumere kikel pokirok moro; gimadwoŋ obedo yeyo ayino ma nyuthere i mar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole onwaŋo wiŋweco maber, to ŋa m'odoko ociero win winjo adieri? Ŋato odwoŋo win nedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiti adwoŋa no kiwoki kwoŋ ŋat'olwoŋo win be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 5:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole nyaka thow manok won ama miyo moko gipi kwot paka iwaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka fodi aridho ni wik'obedi gi paro man m'opokere, to ŋato, kada bedi ŋa, ma ruwo wiy win no, bino wodho cul mere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To an, wutmera, kere raŋo ma fodi ilwenyo kodan k'inen adieri fodi afonjo ni thumirok yenyere? Kole meno nyutho ni fonji paran kwoŋ musalaba pa Kristo di kikwiny jomoro be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayenyo ni joma jokwinyo win no jowomedere gine; weyi jowomedere gi thumirok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To win, wutmera, olwoŋi win ni wibedi i siem. To siem me wokiri wolokere riwin gigoŋirok ma yeyo awanya ma del dhumo win. Kucel, konyere win cungo kwoŋ mar mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 19:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Cik gibe oloki macek i or acel ni, “Mari nyawotin paka iwon imarere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka cale pa wikayere aka wicamere p'ogwaŋe meno kere kure win; ameno winyalo rere woko kicutho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cuny kodi kula pa del",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a gim'awaco: Woth win i Cuny aka wik'otim gim'awanya pa del mito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.7.15+ROM.7.16+ROM.7.17+ROM.7.18+ROM.7.19+ROM.7.20+ROM.7.21+ROM.7.22+ROM.7.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 7:15-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole awanya pa del lwenyo gi Cuny aka Cuny bende lwenyo kodi awanya pa del; jario me jobedo jokwor, aka gino miyo ikinyal timo gim'iyenyo ni itimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Cuny ama telin, meno nyutho ni ikitudere i luwo Cik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gima kula pa del timo neno kamaler: Neno i kidakana, koc, kodi i tim ma kiripi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i lamo cal makicar kodi yido, bedo i kwor gi dhano, laro dwoŋ, timo nyeko, mako ŋonge, gwondo, dhawirok, tiakirok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awanya ri gipa dhano, mero, timo woro, kodi timo gigipiny man ma cale gi me. Anyutho win kicutho paka atieko timo con, joma timo gigipiny me jok'odonji i Ker pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Cuny Maleŋ nyak gigipiny me: Mar, kisangala, siem, diyo cuny, wor, bero, genirok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwolo, kodi kuro cuny. Ongoye cik ma piemo gi gigipiny paka me! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka joma jobedo apa Kristo Yesu jotieko neko woko kula pajo ma del, kodi icirok mere kodi awanya mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wakwo gi meni pa Cuny, meno bende ber wawothi i kwo manyacuny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakiri wabedi ma waparo ni wawegi wacowere, kosa watim kisinye kosa watim nyeko gi joman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
